{
  "id": "RAW_2087949a36",
  "title": "Claude Frontier Academy：投入 1 亿美元培养 10，000 名工程师",
  "url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-frontier-academy",
  "date": "2026-10-03 07:01:00",
  "author": "Anthropic",
  "siteName": "Anthropic News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <article>\n   <div class=\"page-wrapper PostDetail-module-scss-module__UQuRMa__hero\">\n    <div class=\"PostDetail-module-scss-module__UQuRMa__header\">\n     <div class=\"PostDetail-module-scss-module__UQuRMa__subjects body-3 bold\">\n      <br>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"PostDetail-module-scss-module__UQuRMa__illustrationHeroWrapper\">\n     <div class=\"Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__root Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__aspect-wide Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__padding-lg Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__radius-lg bg-heather\">\n      <div class=\"Illustration-module-scss-module__WyGOtq__inner\">\n       <img alt=\"Anthropic invests $100 million to train 10,000 engineers and tackle the enterprise AI talent gap\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/images/4zrzovbb/website/cd4fd51deacd067d4e30aee4f4b149f6cba1b97b-1000x1000.svg\">\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"page-wrapper\">\n    <article>\n     <div class=\"\">\n      <div class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__body\">\n       <p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\"><em>The first-of-its-kind Academy trains Frontier Deployed Engineers using the same standard of skills as Anthropic’s own engineers, starting with cohorts from Accenture, Bain, Capgemini, Commonwealth Bank of Australia, Deloitte, McKinsey, Morgan Stanley, Novo Nordisk and others.</em></p>\n       <p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">Today we are launching Claude Frontier Academy to solve one of the most pressing issues in AI implementation: talent. Backed by a $100 million commitment, Anthropic aims to train 10,000 Frontier Deployed Engineers (FDEs) by the end of 2027. Engineers from Accenture, Bain, Capgemini, Commonwealth Bank of Australia, Deloitte, McKinsey, Morgan Stanley and Novo Nordisk are in the first cohorts.</p>\n       <p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">Every enterprise is racing to bring AI into its organization, but the people with the skills to make it work inside a real business have become the hardest talent to find. Inside the companies we work with, a small group of deeply skilled people drives an outsized share of what AI delivers. The Academy is the first of its kind from an AI company, built from our own work deploying Claude inside the world’s largest enterprises and the professional services organizations that serve them.</p>\n       <p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">“A small team of high-agency people with the right skills, access to Claude, and a deep understanding of how their business runs can transform an entire company. The hard part is building that depth of talent, engineers with the highest level of AI fluency who can take Claude from an idea to a system in production and turn it into faster processes and new products and services. No AI company has invested in developing that talent inside its customers and partners at this depth. Claude Frontier Academy trains people the way our own engineers learn, and we want those who graduate to set the standard for how AI gets built inside a business.” – Steve Corfield, Global Head of Business Development and Partnerships at Anthropic</p>\n       <h2 class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column headline-4 post-heading\" id=\"the-first-program-trains-10000-frontier-deployed-engineers\">The first program trains 10,000 Frontier Deployed Engineers</h2>\n       <p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">The Academy’s first program, the Frontier Deployed Engineer Residency, follows the medical model for building expertise. Doctors learn from practicing physicians, train on real cases, and are assessed before they practice alone. Likewise, FDE Residency engineers learn from practitioners, practice on realistic cases, and are assessed on their work before they earn the credential. The goal is agentic systems that change how a business runs, from faster, redesigned processes to new products and services.</p>\n       <p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">The program is for hands-on software engineers with strong fundamentals, a record of building with LLMs, experience helping others adopt AI, and a habit of tackling their business’s most important problems. Organizations nominate their strongest engineers, each arriving with a named Claude project to lead when they return. Prior experience building AI agents isn’t required.</p>\n       <p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">Engineers start with a multi-day in-person program with Anthropic engineers and licensed instructors. They work through a simulated enterprise deployment, from the right use case through security review to handover, and finish with a graded practical on a new scenario. Those who pass earn the Claude Resident Engineer badge and move into the 12-week residency, where they lead a real Claude use case at their own organization, supported by Anthropic engineers and learning from their cohort as they build. Engineers are assessed again at the end of the 12 weeks, and those who pass earn the Claude Frontier Deployed Engineer badge, with the first expected in early 2027.</p>\n       <h2 class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column headline-4 post-heading\" id=\"the-first-cohorts-are-running-now\">The first cohorts are running now</h2>\n       <p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">Cohorts are running in San Francisco, New York and London. The program will grow toward 10,000 engineers by the end of 2027. Participation is by nomination; organizations can ask their Anthropic account team or Partner Account Manager whether they’re eligible.</p>\n       <h2 class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column headline-4 post-heading\" id=\"leading-enterprises-and-consulting-firms-are-in-the-first-cohorts\">Leading enterprises and consulting firms are in the first cohorts</h2>\n       <div class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__media-column\">\n        <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__carousel-wrapper\">\n         <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__carousel-container\">\n          <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__carousel-track\">\n           <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__carousel-item bg-ivory-medium\">\n            <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-mark-container\">\n             <svg class=\"Icon-module-scss-module__lqbdHG__icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 31\">\n              <path d=\"M16.7999 4.81642C14.2986 5.45109 12.1333 6.45909 10.3039 7.84042C8.51192 9.18442 7.13059 10.8644 6.15992 12.8804C5.18926 14.8964 4.70392 17.1738 4.70392 19.7124H3.47192C3.47192 18.1444 3.95726 16.8938 4.92792 15.9604C5.93592 14.9898 7.27992 14.5044 8.95992 14.5044C10.3786 14.5044 11.6853 14.8591 12.8799 15.5684C14.0746 16.2778 15.0266 17.2298 15.7359 18.4244C16.4453 19.6191 16.7999 20.9258 16.7999 22.3444C16.7999 23.7631 16.4453 25.0698 15.7359 26.2644C15.0266 27.4591 14.0746 28.4111 12.8799 29.1204C11.6853 29.8298 10.3786 30.1844 8.95992 30.1844C7.24259 30.1844 5.69326 29.7364 4.31192 28.8404C2.96792 27.9444 1.90392 26.6938 1.11992 25.0884C0.373255 23.4831 -7.79331e-05 21.6911 -7.79331e-05 19.7124C-7.79331e-05 16.3524 0.690589 13.3097 2.07192 10.5844C3.49059 7.82175 5.45059 5.54442 7.95192 3.75242C10.4906 1.92309 13.4399 0.672418 16.7999 0.000417709V4.81642ZM36.9599 4.81642C34.4586 5.45109 32.2933 6.45909 30.4639 7.84042C28.6719 9.18442 27.2906 10.8644 26.3199 12.8804C25.3493 14.8964 24.8639 17.1738 24.8639 19.7124H23.6319C23.6319 18.1444 24.1173 16.8938 25.0879 15.9604C26.0959 14.9898 27.4399 14.5044 29.1199 14.5044C30.5386 14.5044 31.8453 14.8591 33.0399 15.5684C34.2346 16.2778 35.1866 17.2298 35.8959 18.4244C36.6053 19.6191 36.9599 20.9258 36.9599 22.3444C36.9599 23.7631 36.6053 25.0698 35.8959 26.2644C35.1866 27.4591 34.2346 28.4111 33.0399 29.1204C31.8453 29.8298 30.5386 30.1844 29.1199 30.1844C27.4026 30.1844 25.8533 29.7364 24.4719 28.8404C23.1279 27.9444 22.0639 26.6938 21.2799 25.0884C20.5333 23.4831 20.1599 21.6911 20.1599 19.7124C20.1599 16.3524 20.8506 13.3097 22.2319 10.5844C23.6506 7.82175 25.6106 5.54442 28.1119 3.75242C30.6506 1.92309 33.5999 0.672418 36.9599 0.000417709V4.81642Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n             </svg>\n            </div>\n            <blockquote class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-content\">\n             <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-text body-2 serif\">“At Accenture, forward deployed engineers translate AI ambition into enterprise-wide impact, working inside client workflows as part of multidisciplinary teams that engineer AI concepts into production-ready, governed solutions built to scale. Anthropic built the residency the same way we think about the role: judgment tested against a simulated enterprise deployment, not technical skills in isolation. Joining Claude Frontier Academy will deepen our engineers’ Claude expertise and accelerate the value we deliver for our clients.”</div>\n             <footer class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-footer\">\n              <cite class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-info body-3\"><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-name\">Ram Ramalingam</span> \n               <br> \n               <span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-title\">FDE and Software &amp; Platform Engineering lead</span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__separator\">, </span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__company-name\">Accenture</span></cite>\n             </footer>\n            </blockquote>\n           </div>\n           <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__carousel-item bg-ivory-medium\">\n            <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-mark-container\">\n             <svg class=\"Icon-module-scss-module__lqbdHG__icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 31\">\n              <path d=\"M16.7999 4.81642C14.2986 5.45109 12.1333 6.45909 10.3039 7.84042C8.51192 9.18442 7.13059 10.8644 6.15992 12.8804C5.18926 14.8964 4.70392 17.1738 4.70392 19.7124H3.47192C3.47192 18.1444 3.95726 16.8938 4.92792 15.9604C5.93592 14.9898 7.27992 14.5044 8.95992 14.5044C10.3786 14.5044 11.6853 14.8591 12.8799 15.5684C14.0746 16.2778 15.0266 17.2298 15.7359 18.4244C16.4453 19.6191 16.7999 20.9258 16.7999 22.3444C16.7999 23.7631 16.4453 25.0698 15.7359 26.2644C15.0266 27.4591 14.0746 28.4111 12.8799 29.1204C11.6853 29.8298 10.3786 30.1844 8.95992 30.1844C7.24259 30.1844 5.69326 29.7364 4.31192 28.8404C2.96792 27.9444 1.90392 26.6938 1.11992 25.0884C0.373255 23.4831 -7.79331e-05 21.6911 -7.79331e-05 19.7124C-7.79331e-05 16.3524 0.690589 13.3097 2.07192 10.5844C3.49059 7.82175 5.45059 5.54442 7.95192 3.75242C10.4906 1.92309 13.4399 0.672418 16.7999 0.000417709V4.81642ZM36.9599 4.81642C34.4586 5.45109 32.2933 6.45909 30.4639 7.84042C28.6719 9.18442 27.2906 10.8644 26.3199 12.8804C25.3493 14.8964 24.8639 17.1738 24.8639 19.7124H23.6319C23.6319 18.1444 24.1173 16.8938 25.0879 15.9604C26.0959 14.9898 27.4399 14.5044 29.1199 14.5044C30.5386 14.5044 31.8453 14.8591 33.0399 15.5684C34.2346 16.2778 35.1866 17.2298 35.8959 18.4244C36.6053 19.6191 36.9599 20.9258 36.9599 22.3444C36.9599 23.7631 36.6053 25.0698 35.8959 26.2644C35.1866 27.4591 34.2346 28.4111 33.0399 29.1204C31.8453 29.8298 30.5386 30.1844 29.1199 30.1844C27.4026 30.1844 25.8533 29.7364 24.4719 28.8404C23.1279 27.9444 22.0639 26.6938 21.2799 25.0884C20.5333 23.4831 20.1599 21.6911 20.1599 19.7124C20.1599 16.3524 20.8506 13.3097 22.2319 10.5844C23.6506 7.82175 25.6106 5.54442 28.1119 3.75242C30.6506 1.92309 33.5999 0.672418 36.9599 0.000417709V4.81642Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n             </svg>\n            </div>\n            <blockquote class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-content\">\n             <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-text body-2 serif\">“Building deep, hands-on AI engineering capability is critical to helping clients move from experimentation to impact at scale. The Frontier Deployed Engineer Residency will give our engineers the opportunity to sharpen their expertise working directly with Anthropic and bring that experience to our work with clients.”</div>\n             <footer class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-footer\">\n              <cite class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-info body-3\"><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-name\">Michael Blake</span> \n               <br> \n               <span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-title\">Partner, Global Head of Engineering</span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__separator\">, </span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__company-name\">Bain</span></cite>\n             </footer>\n            </blockquote>\n           </div>\n           <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__carousel-item bg-ivory-medium\">\n            <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-mark-container\">\n             <svg class=\"Icon-module-scss-module__lqbdHG__icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 31\">\n              <path d=\"M16.7999 4.81642C14.2986 5.45109 12.1333 6.45909 10.3039 7.84042C8.51192 9.18442 7.13059 10.8644 6.15992 12.8804C5.18926 14.8964 4.70392 17.1738 4.70392 19.7124H3.47192C3.47192 18.1444 3.95726 16.8938 