pic’s own engineers, Capgemini is investing in and building the delivery excellence that clients recognize immediately.”</div>\n             <footer class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-footer\">\n              <cite class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-info body-3\"><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-name\">Geoffroy Pajot</span> \n               <br> \n               <span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-title\">Global Head of AI Partnerships Ecosystem</span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__separator\">, </span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__company-name\">Capgemini</span></cite>\n             </footer>\n            </blockquote>\n           </div>\n           <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__carousel-item bg-ivory-medium\">\n            <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-mark-container\">\n             <svg class=\"Icon-module-scss-module__lqbdHG__icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 31\">\n              <path d=\"M16.7999 4.81642C14.2986 5.45109 12.1333 6.45909 10.3039 7.84042C8.51192 9.18442 7.13059 10.8644 6.15992 12.8804C5.18926 14.8964 4.70392 17.1738 4.70392 19.7124H3.47192C3.47192 18.1444 3.95726 16.8938 4.92792 15.9604C5.93592 14.9898 7.27992 14.5044 8.95992 14.5044C10.3786 14.5044 11.6853 14.8591 12.8799 15.5684C14.0746 16.2778 15.0266 17.2298 15.7359 18.4244C16.4453 19.6191 16.7999 20.9258 16.7999 22.3444C16.7999 23.7631 16.4453 25.0698 15.7359 26.2644C15.0266 27.4591 14.0746 28.4111 12.8799 29.1204C11.6853 29.8298 10.3786 30.1844 8.95992 30.1844C7.24259 30.1844 5.69326 29.7364 4.31192 28.8404C2.96792 27.9444 1.90392 26.6938 1.11992 25.0884C0.373255 23.4831 -7.79331e-05 21.6911 -7.79331e-05 19.7124C-7.79331e-05 16.3524 0.690589 13.3097 2.07192 10.5844C3.49059 7.82175 5.45059 5.54442 7.95192 3.75242C10.4906 1.92309 13.4399 0.672418 16.7999 0.000417709V4.81642ZM36.9599 4.81642C34.4586 5.45109 32.2933 6.45909 30.4639 7.84042C28.6719 9.18442 27.2906 10.8644 26.3199 12.8804C25.3493 14.8964 24.8639 17.1738 24.8639 19.7124H23.6319C23.6319 18.1444 24.1173 16.8938 25.0879 15.9604C26.0959 14.9898 27.4399 14.5044 29.1199 14.5044C30.5386 14.5044 31.8453 14.8591 33.0399 15.5684C34.2346 16.2778 35.1866 17.2298 35.8959 18.4244C36.6053 19.6191 36.9599 20.9258 36.9599 22.3444C36.9599 23.7631 36.6053 25.0698 35.8959 26.2644C35.1866 27.4591 34.2346 28.4111 33.0399 29.1204C31.8453 29.8298 30.5386 30.1844 29.1199 30.1844C27.4026 30.1844 25.8533 29.7364 24.4719 28.8404C23.1279 27.9444 22.0639 26.6938 21.2799 25.0884C20.5333 23.4831 20.1599 21.6911 20.1599 19.7124C20.1599 16.3524 20.8506 13.3097 22.2319 10.5844C23.6506 7.82175 25.6106 5.54442 28.1119 3.75242C30.6506 1.92309 33.5999 0.672418 36.9599 0.000417709V4.81642Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n             </svg>\n            </div>\n            <blockquote class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-content\">\n             <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-text body-2 serif\">“AI is transforming the way we build, deliver and innovate for customers. Our engineers use AI tools every day, and our teams have produced up to 3x more code changes in the past year. The Frontier Deployed Engineer Residency takes them deeper, with hands-on experience building, securing and shipping alongside peers at the frontier. We are building tomorrow’s bank today, and this program gives our teams the tools and expertise to engineer the best possible products for our customers.”</div>\n             <footer class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-footer\">\n              <cite class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-info body-3\"><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-name\">Rodrigo Castillo</span> \n               <br> \n               <span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-title\">Group Chief Technology Officer</span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__separator\">, </span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__company-name\">Commonwealth Bank of Australia</span></cite>\n             </footer>\n            </blockquote>\n           </div>\n           <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__carousel-item bg-ivory-medium\">\n            <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-mark-container\">\n             <svg class=\"Icon-module-scss-module__lqbdHG__icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 31\">\n              <path d=\"M16.7999 4.81642C14.2986 5.45109 12.1333 6.45909 10.3039 7.84042C8.51192 9.18442 7.13059 10.8644 6.15992 12.8804C5.18926 14.8964 4.70392 17.1738 4.70392 19.7124H3.47192C3.47192 18.1444 3.95726 16.8938 4.92792 15.9604C5.93592 14.9898 7.27992 14.5044 8.95992 14.5044C10.3786 14.5044 11.6853 14.8591 12.8799 15.5684C14.0746 16.2778 15.0266 17.2298 15.7359 18.4244C16.4453 19.6191 16.7999 20.9258 16.7999 22.3444C16.7999 23.7631 16.4453 25.0698 15.7359 26.2644C15.0266 27.4591 14.0746 28.4111 12.8799 29.1204C11.6853 29.8298 10.3786 30.1844 8.95992 30.1844C7.24259 30.1844 5.69326 29.7364 4.31192 28.8404C2.96792 27.9444 1.90392 26.6938 1.11992 25.0884C0.373255 23.4831 -7.79331e-05 21.6911 -7.79331e-05 19.7124C-7.79331e-05 16.3524 0.690589 13.3097 2.07192 10.5844C3.49059 7.82175 5.45059 5.54442 7.95192 3.75242C10.4906 1.92309 13.4399 0.672418 16.7999 0.000417709V4.81642ZM36.9599 4.81642C34.4586 5.45109 32.2933 6.45909 30.4639 7.84042C28.6719 9.18442 27.2906 10.8644 26.3199 12.8804C25.3493 14.8964 24.8639 17.1738 24.8639 19.7124H23.6319C23.6319 18.1444 24.1173 16.8938 25.0879 15.9604C26.0959 14.9898 27.4399 14.5044 29.1199 14.5044C30.5386 14.5044 31.8453 14.8591 33.0399 15.5684C34.2346 16.2778 35.1866 17.2298 35.8959 18.4244C36.6053 19.6191 36.9599 20.9258 36.9599 22.3444C36.9599 23.7631 36.6053 25.0698 35.8959 26.2644C35.1866 27.4591 34.2346 28.4111 33.0399 29.1204C31.8453 29.8298 30.5386 30.1844 29.1199 30.1844C27.4026 30.1844 25.8533 29.7364 24.4719 28.8404C23.1279 27.9444 22.0639 26.6938 21.2799 25.0884C20.5333 23.4831 20.1599 21.6911 20.1599 19.7124C20.1599 16.3524 20.8506 13.3097 22.2319 10.5844C23.6506 7.82175 25.6106 5.54442 28.1119 3.75242C30.6506 1.92309 33.5999 0.672418 36.9599 0.000417709V4.81642Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n             </svg>\n            </div>\n            <blockquote class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-content\">\n             <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-text body-2 serif\">“AI deployment at enterprise scale requires skilled people who can drive a project from first requirements through security review to real adoption. The Claude Frontier Academy’s FDE Residency enables us to scale a discipline we’ve already tested in the field, which is why we are excited to be part of the inaugural cohort, bringing our engineers in early to extend our bench of Claude-ready talent.”</div>\n             <footer class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-footer\">\n              <cite class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-info body-3\"><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-name\">Faruk Muratovic</span> \n               <br> \n               <span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-title\">Principal</span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__separator\">, </span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__company-name\">Deloitte Consulting LLP</span></cite>\n             </footer>\n            </blockquote>\n           </div>\n           <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__carousel-item bg-ivory-medium\">\n            <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-mark-container\">\n             <svg class=\"Icon-module-scss-module__lqbdHG__icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 31\">\n              <path d=\"M16.7999 4.81642C14.2986 5.45109 12.1333 6.45909 10.3039 7.84042C8.51192 9.18442 7.13059 10.8644 6.15992 12.8804C5.18926 14.8964 4.70392 17.1738 4.70392 19.7124H3.47192C3.47192 18.1444 3.95726 16.8938 4.92792 15.9604C5.93592 14.9898 7.27992 14.5044 8.95992 14.5044C10.3786 14.5044 11.6853 14.8591 12.8799 15.5684C14.0746 16.2778 15.0266 17.2298 15.7359 18.4244C16.4453 19.6191 16.7999 20.9258 16.7999 22.3444C16.7999 23.7631 16.4453 25.0698 15.7359 26.2644C15.0266 27.4591 14.0746 28.4111 12.8799 29.1204C11.6853 29.8298 10.3786 30.1844 8.95992 30.1844C7.24259 30.1844 5.69326 29.7364 4.31192 28.8404C2.96792 27.9444 1.90392 26.6938 1.11992 25.0884C0.373255 23.4831 -7.79331e-05 21.6911 -7.79331e-05 19.7124C-7.79331e-05 16.3524 0.690589 13.3097 2.07192 10.5844C3.49059 7.82175 5.45059 5.54442 7.95192 3.75242C10.4906 1.92309 13.4399 0.672418 16.7999 0.000417709V4.81642ZM36.9599 4.81642C34.4586 5.45109 32.2933 6.45909 30.4639 7.84042C28.6719 9.18442 27.2906 10.8644 26.3199 12.8804C25.3493 14.8964 24.8639 17.1738 24.8639 19.7124H23.6319C23.6319 18.1444 24.1173 16.8938 25.0879 15.9604C26.0959 14.9898 27.4399 14.5044 29.1199 14.5044C30.5386 14.5044 31.8453 14.8591 33.0399 15.5684C34.2346 16.2778 35.1866 17.2298 35.8959 18.4244C36.6053 19.6191 36.9599 20.9258 36.9599 22.3444C36.9599 23.7631 36.6053 25.0698 35.8959 26.2644C35.1866 27.4591 34.2346 28.4111 33.0399 29.1204C31.8453 29.8298 30.5386 30.1844 29.1199 30.1844C27.4026 30.1844 25.8533 29.7364 24.4719 28.8404C23.1279 27.9444 22.0639 26.6938 21.2799 25.0884C20.5333 23.4831 20.1599 21.6911 20.1599 19.7124C20.1599 16.3524 20.8506 13.3097 22.2319 10.5844C23.6506 7.82175 25.6106 5.54442 28.1119 3.75242C30.6506 1.92309 33.5999 0.672418 36.9599 0.000417709V4.81642Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n             </svg>\n            </div>\n            <blockquote class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-content\">\n             <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-text body-2 serif\">“This collaboration between McKinsey and Anthropic is about leveraging frontier AI to create superior business outcomes for clients. Our technologists bring frontier AI expertise, sector depth and a value-creation mindset to our client work. The Residency sets the bar for how they apply Claude in service of our clients’ business goals, giving our world-class talent experience learning frontier techniques alongside Anthropic’s engineers. The Claude Frontier Academy and FDE Residency extend our technologists’ toolkit, helping them solve our clients’ toughest problems hands-on-keys.”</div>\n             <footer class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-footer\">\n              <cite class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-info body-3\"><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-name\">Dan Tinkoff</span> \n               <br> \n               <span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-title\">Senior Partner and Global Co-leader of QuantumBlack</span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__separator\">, </span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__company-name\">McKinsey</span></cite>\n             </footer>\n            </blockquote>\n           </div>\n           <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__carousel-item bg-ivory-medium\">\n            <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-mark-container\">\n             <svg class=\"Icon-module-scss-module__lqbdHG__icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 31\">\n              <path d=\"M16.7999 4.81642C14.2986 5.45109 12.1333 6.45909 10.3039 7.84042C8.51192 9.18442 7.13059 10.8644 6.15992 12.8804C5.18926 14.8964 4.70392 17.1738 4.70392 19.7124H3.47192C3.47192 18.1444 3.95726 16.8938 4.92792 15.9604C5.93592 14.9898 7.27992 14.5044 8.95992 14.5044C10.3786 14.5044 11.6853 14.8591 12.8799 15.5684C14.0746 16.2778 15.0266 17.2298 15.7359 18.4244C16.4453 19.6191 16.7999 20.9258 16.7999 22.3444C16.7999 23.7631 16.4453 25.0698 15.7359 26.2644C15.0266 27.4591 14.0746 28.4111 12.8799 29.1204C11.6853 29.8298 10.3786 30.1844 8.95992 30.1844C7.24259 30.1844 5.69326 29.7364 4.31192 28.8404C2.96792 27.9444 1.90392 26.6938 1.11992 25.0884C0.373255 23.4831 -7.79331e-05 21.6911 -7.79331e-05 19.7124C-7.79331e-05 16.3524 0.690589 13.3097 2.07192 10.5844C3.49059 7.82175 5.45059 5.54442 7.95192 3.75242C10.4906 1.92309 13.4399 0.672418 16.7999 0.000417709V4.81642ZM36.9599 4.81642C34.4586 5.45109 32.2933 6.45909 30.4639 7.84042C28.6719 9.18442 27.2906 10.8644 26.3199 12.8804C25.3493 14.8964 24.8639 17.1738 24.8639 19.7124H23.6319C23.6319 18.1444 24.1173 16.8938 25.0879 15.9604C26.0959 14.9898 27.4399 14.5044 29.1199 14.5044C30.5386 14.5044 31.8453 14.8591 33.0399 15.5684C34.2346 16.2778 35.1866 17.2298 35.8959 18.4244C36.6053 19.6191 36.9599 20.9258 36.9599 22.3444C36.9599 23.7631 36.6053 25.0698 35.8959 26.2644C35.1866 27.4591 34.2346 28.4111 33.0399 29.1204C31.8453 29.8298 30.5386 30.1844 29.1199 30.1844C27.4026 30.1844 25.8533 29.7364 24.4719 28.8404C23.1279 27.9444 22.0639 26.6938 21.2799 25.0884C20.5333 23.4831 20.1599 21.6911 20.1599 19.7124C20.1599 16.3524 20.8506 13.3097 22.2319 10.5844C23.6506 7.82175 25.6106 5.54442 28.1119 3.75242C30.6506 1.92309 33.5999 0.672418 36.9599 0.000417709V4.81642Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n             </svg>\n            </div>\n            <blockquote class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-content\">\n             <div class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-text body-2 serif\">“AI is already changing how we discover and develop medicines at Novo. With Claude Science in our R&amp;D workflows, Anthropic’s frontier models in our software development, lab in the loop research in drug discovery, and Anthropic engineers working alongside our scientists, we have seen what is possible when frontier AI meets deep scientific expertise. We’re excited to join the Claude Frontier Academy and the FDE Residency, giving our engineers the same hands on training and expertise behind Anthropic’s most successful deployments, so together we can bring the next generation of medicines to patients faster.”</div>\n             <footer class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__quote-footer\">\n              <cite class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-info body-3\"><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-name\">Loic Giraud</span> \n               <br> \n               <span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__speaker-title\">VP Data &amp; AI</span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__separator\">, </span><span class=\"QuoteCarousel-module-scss-module__XVJWRG__company-name\">Novo Nordisk</span></cite>\n             </footer>\n            </blockquote>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__carousel-controls body-3\">\n          <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__counter\">\n           <span>01</span> / 07\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__arrow-controls\">\n           <button class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__arrow-button Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__arrow-prev\" disabled aria-label=\"Previous quote\">\n            <svg class=\"Icon-module-scss-module__lqbdHG__icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 8 5\">\n             <path d=\"M7.3016 0.231808C7.44932 0.0678162 7.70306 0.0546398 7.86724 0.20212C8.03137 0.349888 8.04461 0.603568 7.89692 0.767766L4.29684 4.76791L4.23434 4.82417C4.16662 4.87328 4.08425 4.89995 3.99918 4.89995C3.88588 4.89989 3.77733 4.85213 3.70152 4.76791L0.10144 0.767766L0.0537825 0.702139C-0.040206 0.541753 -0.0124254 0.331356 0.131128 0.20212C0.274775 0.0728844 0.486972 0.0674593 0.636608 0.1779L0.696765 0.231808L3.99918 3.90148L7.3016 0.231808Z\" fill=\"#141413\"></path>\n            </svg>\n           </button>\n           <button class=\"Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__arrow-button Carousel-module-scss-module__hqckjG__arrow-next\" aria-label=\"Next quote\">\n            <svg class=\"Icon-module-scss-module__lqbdHG__icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 8 5\">\n             <path d=\"M7.3016 0.231808C7.44932 0.0678162 7.70306 0.0546398 7.86724 0.20212C8.03137 0.349888 8.04461 0.603568 7.89692 0.767766L4.29684 4.76791L4.23434 4.82417C4.16662 4.87328 4.08425 4.89995 3.99918 4.89995C3.88588 4.89989 3.77733 4.85213 3.70152 4.76791L0.10144 0.767766L0.0537825 0.702139C-0.040206 0.541753 -0.0124254 0.331356 0.131128 0.20212C0.274775 0.0728844 0.486972 0.0674593 0.636608 0.1779L0.696765 0.231808L3.99918 3.90148L7.3016 0.231808Z\" fill=\"#141413\"></path>\n            </svg>\n           </button>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <h2 class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column headline-4 post-heading\" id=\"the-claude-partner-network\">The Claude Partner Network</h2>\n       <p class=\"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column body-2 serif post-text\">Claude Frontier Academy builds on the <a href=\"https://claude.com/blog/four-role-based-claude-certifications\">Claude Partner Network</a>, where professionals across 46,000 firms have earned more than 175,000 Claude certifications and nearly 4,000 people have completed Basecamp, an immersive program that teaches the same curriculum our Applied AI teams receive when they onboard. Claude Frontier Academy is for the people who will lead the work, and training 10,000 Frontier Deployed Engineers is the first step of many.</p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </article>\n   </div>\n   <section class=\"LandingPageSection-module-scss-module__ZSMdoa__root\">\n    <div class=\"page-wrapper\">\n     <div class=\"LinkGrid-module-scss-module__wTN57W__root\">\n      <div class=\"LinkGrid-module-scss-module__wTN57W__items LinkGrid-module-scss-module__wTN57W__threeItems\"></div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </section>\n  </article>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Anthropic 启动了耗资 1 亿美元的 Frontier Academy，旨在通过驻留制计划培训 10，000 名「前沿部署工程师」，以弥补 AI 实施领域的人才缺口。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Anthropic 启动了耗资 1 亿美元的 Frontier Academy，旨在通过驻留制计划培训 10，000 名「前沿部署工程师」，以弥补 AI 实施领域的人才缺口。",
  "summary": "Anthropic 推出了 Claude Frontier Academy，这是一项耗资 1 亿美元的计划，旨在解决企业级 AI 实施的人才缺口。该计划目标到 2027 年通过为期 12 周的驻留模式培养 10，000 名前沿部署工程师（FDE），来自合作伙伴机构的工程师将与 Anthropic 团队合作，构建生产就绪系统。早期主要合作伙伴包括웨世、麦肯锡、德勤、摩根士丹和诺和诺德。该计划的重点在于超越基础认证，转向在复杂的业务环境中对智能体系统进行实操经验。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Claude Frontier Academy 启动",
      "explanation": "Anthropic 正在投入 1 亿美元培养 10，000 名工程师，以解决能够在大规模业务环境中实施前沿 AI 的关键人才严重匮缺的问题。"
    },
    {
      "point": "驻留制培训模式",
      "explanation": "与标准认证不同，该计划采用为期 12 周的驻留模式，工程师直接与 Anthropic 员工合作，在模拟和真实的部署中进行学习，以确保熟练度。"
    },
    {
      "point": "战略性行业合作伙伴",
      "explanation": "웨世、埃森哲和诺和诺德等全球知名公司正参与首批培训，为为其技术团队应对 AI 驱动的工作流做好准备。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "每家企业都在竞相将 AI 引入其组织，但那些能够在业务内部使其运行起来的人才已成为最难寻找的人才。",
    "前沿部署工程师模式遵循构建专业知识的医学模式：医生从执业医生那里学习，在真实案例中进行训练，并在独立执业前接受评估。",
    "目标是构建改变业务运行方式的智能体系统。"
  ],
  "tags": [
    "商业与创业",
